Origin
------
PTU was built in 2026 under the working name of a company project ("Meter")
that has since been retired; some local directory defaults and identifiers in
the code (for example ~/.meter-harness and ~/meter-runs) keep that name. Parts
of the code, task files and documentation were written with the help of AI
coding assistants and reviewed by the author.

